{"ref":"BDB, עָשָׁן²","hw":"עָשָׁן²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָשָׁן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Shephelah of Judah <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:42\" href=\"/Joshua.15.42\">Jos 15:42</a>, in Simeon according to <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:7\" href=\"/Joshua.19.7\">19:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.32\">1 Ch 4:32</a>, Levit. city <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.44\">6:44</a>; Ασαν, etc.; = <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹר עָשָׁן</span>, q.v. p. 92 supr.","next":"BDB, עָשַׁק","prev":"BDB, עָשֵׁן"}